From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrei Aldea <andrei1998@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 15:36:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: ti: build BeagleY-AI EdgeAI DTBs

The K3 boot script loads one complete device tree and does not apply the
BeagleY-AI EdgeAI and camera overlays at boot. Build composed device
trees so the EdgeAI memory ABI can be selected through the normal
fdtfile/TFTP DTB path without changing the base board DTB.

Provide an EdgeAI-only image and an EdgeAI plus CSI0 IMX219 image. Both
inherit the normal BeagleY-AI board description, including its USB and
PCIe enablement.

Signed-off-by: Andrei Aldea <andrei1998@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
index abe052e06d9a..550b6978723f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/ti/Makefile
@@ -140,6 +140,14 @@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai-csi0-imx219.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-apps.dtbo
+k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-dtbs := k3-am67a-beagley-ai.dtb \
+	 k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-apps.dtbo
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai.dtb
+k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-csi0-imx219-dtbs := \
+	 k3-am67a-beagley-ai.dtb \
+	 k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-apps.dtbo \
+	 k3-am67a-beagley-ai-csi0-imx219.dtbo
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-am67a-beagley-ai-edgeai-csi0-imx219.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm-csi2-quad-rpi-cam-imx219.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_K3) += k3-j722s-evm-csi2-quad-tevi-ov5640.dtbo
